<div class="container flex-container mb-5 pb-5">    
    <article class="mt-5 content" id="contact-us">
        <section id="our-commitment">
            {# <h2 class="pipe mb-3" id="best-service-possible">We strive to provide the best service possible with every contact!</h2> #}
            <p>S. Phaneuf & Associates has been serving homeowners, businesses, and property managers throughout Massachusetts since 1989. Whether you're planning a custom patio, new asphalt driveway, excavation project, commercial parking lot, or winter snow management contract, our experienced team is here to answer your questions, discuss your project, and provide a free consultation.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="pt-4" id="contact-methods">
            <h2 class="pipe mt-5" id="reach-out">Reach Out to Us Today!</h2>
            <p>We are happy to assist with any inquiries. Whether you're an existing client or looking for new opportunities, here's how you can get in touch:</p>
            
            <h3 class="c-b mt-5" id="email-us">Email Us</h3>
            <p class="pt-1 pb-1">For general inquiries or service details, email us at:</p>
            <ul><li><strong>General Inquiries: </strong><a href="mailto:info@phaneufassociates.com" class="fw-6">info@phaneufassociates.com</a></li></ul>
            <p class="pt-1">We respond to all emails within <strong>24 hours</strong> during business days (Monday - Friday).</p>
            
            <h3 class="c-b mt-5" id="call-us">Call Us</h3>
            <p class="py-1">If you need immediate assistance, please call us during business hours:</p>
            <ul><li><strong>Phone: </strong><a href="tel:+19786694919" class="fw-6">(978) 669-4919</a></li><li><strong>Business Hours:</strong> Monday - Friday, 8 AM - 4 PM (EST)</li></ul>
            
            <h3 class="c-b mt-5" id="mailing-address">Mailing Address</h3>
            <p class="pt-1 pb-1">If you prefer to send us documents, contracts, or other materials via mail, please use the following address:</p>
            <address class="py-1 ms-4"><strong>S. Phaneuf & Associates</strong><br>P.O. Box 190<br>Groton, MA 01450 </address>
            <p class="pt-1 pb-1">Please allow additional time for postal deliveries. For faster service, we recommend using the other contact methods listed above.</p>

            <h3 class="c-b mt-5" id="social-media">Follow Us on Social Media</h3>
            <p class="py-1">Stay connected with us for updates, insights, and news:</p>
            <ul>
                <li><b>Instagram:</b> <a href="https://www.instagram.com/phaneufassociates/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="fw-6">phaneufassociates</a></li>
                <li><b>Facebook:</b> <a href="https://www.facebook.com/p/Phaneuf-Associates-100054709692721" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="fw-6">Phaneuf Associates</a></li>
                <li><b>LinkedIn:</b> <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/phaneuf-associates-incorporated/about/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="fw-6">Phaneuf Associates Incorporated</a></li>
                <li><b>Yelp:</b> <a href="https://www.yelp.com/biz/s-phaneuf-and-associates-groton" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="fw-6">s-phaneuf-and-associates-groton</a></li>
            </ul>
        </section>


        <section id="why-choose-phaneuf" class="py-5">
            <h2 class="pipe">Why Massachusetts Property Owners Choose S. Phaneuf & Associates</h2>
            <p class="pt-4">Choosing the right contractor is one of the most important decisions you'll make for your property. Since 1989, S. Phaneuf & Associates has built a reputation throughout Massachusetts for delivering dependable service, quality craftsmanship, and construction solutions that stand the test of time.</p>
            <div class="row mt-4">
                <div class="col-md-6 mb-4">
                    <h3>More Than 35 Years of Experience</h3>
                    <p>Our experienced team has completed residential and commercial masonry, asphalt paving, excavation, and site development projects throughout Massachusetts since 1989.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="col-md-6 mb-4">
                    <h3>Complete Construction Services</h3>
                    <p>From custom patios and retaining walls to asphalt paving, drainage improvements, excavation, and commercial snow management, we provide multiple services under one trusted company.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="col-md-6 mb-4">
                    <h3>Quality Workmanship</h3>
                    <p>Every project is completed with careful planning, quality materials, attention to detail, and skilled craftsmanship designed to deliver lasting performance and curb appeal.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="col-md-6 mb-4">
                    <h3>Serving Communities Throughout Massachusetts</h3>
                    <p>We proudly serve homeowners, businesses, property managers, municipalities, and general contractors throughout Greater Boston, Central Massachusetts, and many surrounding communities.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section id="what-happens-next" class="py-5">
            <h2 class="pipe">What Happens After You Contact Us?</h2>
            <p class="pt-4">We know that planning a construction project can feel overwhelming. Our goal is to make the process simple, transparent, and stress-free from your first call through project completion.</p>
            <div class="mt-4">
                <h3>1. Tell Us About Your Project</h3>
                <p>Contact us by phone, email, or through the contact form. Let us know what type of project you're planning, where it's located, and any questions you may have.</p>
                <h3 class="mt-4">2. Schedule a Consultation</h3>
                <p>We'll review your project, discuss your goals, and arrange a convenient time to evaluate the property if needed. Every project is different, and we take the time to understand your specific needs.</p>
                <h3 class="mt-4">3. Receive a Detailed Estimate</h3>
                <p>We'll provide a clear estimate outlining the scope of work and answer any questions so you can make an informed decision before moving forward.</p>
                <h3 class="mt-4">4. Begin Your Project</h3>
                <p>Once you're ready, our experienced team schedules your project and keeps you informed throughout every phase of construction. We focus on quality workmanship, dependable communication, and completing every project to the highest standards.</p>
            </div>
        </section>


        <section id="contact-faq" class="py-5">
            <h2 class="pipe">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
            <p class="pt-4">Have questions before contacting us? Here are answers to some of the questions we receive most often. If you don't see your question below, feel free to call or complete our contact form. We're always happy to help.</p>
            <h3>Do you provide free estimates?</h3>
            <p>Yes. We provide free consultations and estimates for residential and commercial projects throughout Massachusetts. We'll discuss your project, answer your questions, and recommend the best solution for your property.</p>
            <h3>What types of projects do you work on?</h3>
            <p>We specialize in masonry and hardscapes, asphalt paving, excavation and site development, drainage solutions, retaining walls, outdoor living spaces, and commercial snow and ice management.</p>
            <h3>What areas do you serve?</h3>
            <p>We proudly serve homeowners, businesses, municipalities, and property managers throughout Greater Boston, Central Massachusetts, and many surrounding communities. Visit our <a href="/service-areas">Service Areas</a> page for more information.</p>
            <h3>How quickly will someone respond to my inquiry?</h3>
            <p>We make every effort to respond to all inquiries within one business day. If your request is urgent, we recommend calling our office during normal business hours.</p>
            <h3>Can I request an estimate online?</h3>
            <p>Absolutely. Complete the contact form with as much information as possible about your project, and a member of our team will contact you to discuss the next steps.</p>
            <h3>Do you work with both residential and commercial clients?</h3>
            <p>Yes. Our team completes projects for homeowners, commercial property owners, property managers, municipalities, and general contractors throughout Massachusetts.</p>
            <h3>What information should I include when contacting you?</h3>
            <p>Please include your location, the type of project you're planning, an estimated timeline, and any details that will help us understand your goals. Photos are also helpful when available.</p>
            <h3>Are you licensed and insured?</h3>
            <p>Yes. S. Phaneuf & Associates is fully licensed and insured, giving our customers confidence that every project is completed professionally and responsibly.</p>
            <h3>Can you help if I'm not sure exactly what I need?</h3>
            <p>Of course. Many clients contact us during the planning stage. We'll discuss your ideas, explain your options, and help you determine the best solution based on your property, budget, and long-term goals.</p>
            <h3>How do I get started?</h3>
            <p>Simply call us or complete the contact form on this page. We'll schedule a consultation, review your project, and provide a detailed estimate so you can move forward with confidence.</p>
        </section>
        

        <section id="privacy-security">
            <h2 class="pipe mt-5" id="privacy-policy-assurance">Privacy & Security Assurances</h2>
            <p class="py-1">Your privacy is important to us. Any personal information you submit will be kept confidential and used solely to respond to your inquiry. For more information, view our <a href="/privacy-policy" class="fw-6">Privacy Policy</a>.</p>
        </section>
    </article>

